<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Niger state have killed a village head and several others in Borgu and Lumma Ba’are, and gunmen attacked a mosque, killing five worshippers. Fulani civilians have been killed in reprisal attacks after a village leader’s murder, with dozens reported dead. JNIM militants have struck 30 locations in Mali, prompting calls for dialogue, while Benin is intensifying operations against jihadists near the Nigeria border. The Sahel jihadist insurgency produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Internazionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPdmtwRTVDdnF6SDYwRnNtZHFFUzFvZE5Qd2NvNzRQMUw2N0tUekc5VjQwaE51WEI4NmNZX1NUeGc0YTdIWkgwRmU1ZjdXUjN3ZDdLZmh4S1k5LW00NDhmdlg4UUItUjhpTUdyVXVtMzQ5dFdVcUp5OVE1dTB1aGlldGRVNEtQSlVJQ1ZwbmpMR2VnLVpBWHNRa09mdlY3UVo2bWlIT3VqVGtJV1ZTSnRwZGQ4cTZTQ0VCUDVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Maliweb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOMFFtSV80aUQ3VW1BbF9Ya1dvWG9ZcmxmNkk1X1E4Q3BYb3R5TUFVMU52TlR6NnZaYlJCS192bEpwVzV5Zk95amYyY2EtRzRFbTBxcFFUY0t1THk1cUhIVGxpY3ZOYnUyTnVVRDRKR3ZKSXhlMkd1akFBYkpJaWw1blA1U1E5RUJqSHZJdVNmQkR3dWpOS3UwcUZ3NFJScXRkcExBcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNVXFON0FmNVVQa3J4aUVaQ2JDMHlsYWVqRW01NDZ0Q2gzbHN3OFB1MnYzYWlTeWFZcnlVMlN0dUFVM3dtc09wOEJPeWp3OVNFQ3Brck1CVnVZNWJKLXoxem1xUjF6YVlKN1htVWtxVmFyOTJWeTl5ckdjbndPeDN0TDlxSXlYY2lLX2tkRkI1Y19GNy1VQzdHYzBYUWdqRGNrdTF3WW1CYjV3NlV4Y3NySFVQOUc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Africa Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPNU14S3dhMzA0SXVNMVdoVHBraVN1NHNsaWFlWWVDaktvMzBBa1RhdFE2VDVSRGR1VFJCMUNNeXJpYldzX0pnczhhTkszSXRBcXV3TEtsclRXai05RFdpUGJ0OGdDeFBPaFhFOFFMTVk2V21jUWwy